          %p
            This is due to
            %a{:href => "#Elmendorf83"} Elmendorf 83
            and
            = succeed ";" do
              %a{:href => "#DwyerKan84"} Dwyer-Kan 84, Sec. 1.2, 1.7 &amp; Thm. 3.1
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#AssumptionsAndRefinementsInTheLiterature"}
            below) given by
