            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "#Blumberg17"} Blumberg 17, Sec. 1.3
          %p
            In particular this means that the
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
