                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H_i
              in the given family) – but with that understood, the above equivalence holds, by
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#DwyerKan84"} Dwyer-Kan 84, Sec. 1.2, 1.7 &amp; Thm. 3.1
            %p To bring this out, write
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
