                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (G, \mathcal{F})CWCplx \hookrightarrow G Top
                  for the
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/full+subcategory"} full subcategory
                  of
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/G-CW+complexes"} G-CW complexes
                  build via these coset spaces, then
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
